Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||06-07-2000||08:36 AM||||I was looking for a nice CD/Radio Receiver for my Fiero and found a great deal on a Pioneer <A HREF="http://www.pioneerelectronics.com/Car_2000/deh-p77dh.htm" TARGET=_blank>DEH-P77DH</A>. You can find it <A HREF="http://www.marketplace4u.com/marketplace/product.asp?action=form&product=1024533" TARGET=_blank>here</A>. The item is currently on backorder but I have contacted the company and they say it will be in stock again soon.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.pioneerelectronics.com/assets/Car_2000/deh-p77dh.jpg"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||bHooper||06-07-2000||09:20 AM||||Cool looking CD player!  I think it's always worth it to buy the better equipment.<P><BR>Example: I plugged my AIAWA head unit back into my GT, after 4 years of no power... it was still holding its memory!  All the presets were still there!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
